---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us | Angat Iskolar PUP">
    <Hero title="SERVING THE PEOPLE, THE ANGAT WAY">
        <p class="text-lg opacity-90 mt-2">[Hero Subtitle Pending from CMS]</p>
    </Hero>

    <!-- About Us Content Section -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 flex flex-col items-center bg-transparent">
        <!-- Pink Pill Header -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-aip-cerise to-aip-punch text-white px-12 py-3 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-aip-punch/30 mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">ABOUT US</h2>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Large Text Card (Glowing Shadow) -->
        <div class="w-full max-w-5xl bg-gradient-to-r from-aip-cerise to-aip-punch text-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[40px] shadow-2xl shadow-aip-punch/20 text-center md:text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6">
            <p>
                Established on October 7, 2022, ANGAT Iskolar PUP traces its roots to the principle of Iskolar ng Bayan, Iskolar para sa Bayan, recognizing the community as an integral part of every Iskolar ng Bayan’s educational journey. This principle reflects AIP’s belief that education extends beyond the individual and becomes more meaningful when it contributes to the growth and development of the communities that make it possible. Grounded in this principle, AIP began as a student-led volunteer initiative dedicated to public service, community engagement, and youth leadership. Through the collective efforts of its volunteers, the organization has pursued initiatives that respond to various social needs, creating opportunities for students to apply their learning beyond the university and engage in meaningful community work.
            </p>
            <p>
                Over the years, AIP has continued to develop its advocacies in Education, Environmental and Agricultural Development, Gender Equality and Social Harmony, Good Governance, and Health. Through its initiatives, the organization has fostered leadership development, community partnerships, and collaborative action. As AIP evolved, so did its internal structure. Previously composed of nine committees, the organization transitioned to five committees in the current term by merging related advocacies to strengthen coordination and encourage greater collaboration among its volunteers. Through these developments, ANGAT Iskolar PUP continues to strengthen its commitment to volunteerism, community engagement, and collective action.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Mission and Vision Section -->
        <div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-16 max-w-5xl bg-transparent">
            <!-- Mission Card -->
            <div class="relative w-full h-[500px] md:h-[600px] rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8 md:p-10 shadow-xl shadow-gray-300">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-aip-plum/90 via-aip-plum/70 to-aip-plum/90 z-0"></div>
                <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white/30 z-0">
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">[Background Image Pending]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="relative z-10 w-full text-center mt-4">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 tracking-wider">OUR MISSION</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="relative z-10 border-l-4 border-white pl-6 text-white mb-4">
                    <p class="text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        The organization shall pursue to create a long-term community of the largest mobilization of volunteer Iskolar ng Bayan throughout the PUP system for community-based projects through the ten (10) centers of participation to actively partake in nation-building and help the marginalized sector of our society.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Vision Card -->
            <div class="relative w-full h-[500px] md:h-[600px] rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8 md:p-10 shadow-xl shadow-gray-300">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-aip-plum/90 via-aip-plum/70 to-aip-plum/90 z-0"></div>
                <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white/30 z-0">
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">[Background Image Pending]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="relative z-10 w-full text-center mt-4">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 tracking-wider">OUR VISION</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="relative z-10 border-l-4 border-white pl-6 text-white mb-4">
                    <p class="text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        The organization shall envision to hone young leaders holistically who practice empathy, become agents of good governance, and promote volunteerism in communities. Angat Iskolar PUP aims to develop every Iskolar through active community participation to not only put into practice what they learned in the university but also incline their leadership towards a service-centered leadership for the people and the country.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>